      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"Anti-Moderation\" is useless when it comes to the photon exploits which the players are abusing.\n\nThe reason why they are creating chaos by using automated bots to kick people is to make the devs raise their eyebrows and get their attention to patch these exploits. They have tried to contact the devs multiple times with fixes and instructions but the devs reply with the middle finger and they don't give a shit. They realized that abusing it hard is the fastest way to get it patched.",
      "viewerReactions": null
