      "value": "@{5a95256f54d514123c1f089d|full_name}: Do you know about filtering enabled on games such as ROBLOX? It is a concept that doesn't allow the client to modify serverside scripts, and it worked so well in ROBLOX that the exploiting community is dead. \nNow imagine if VRChat used that along with IP spoofing against clients that attempt to grab it. Perfection.",
